    "paper_statement": "AMBR is enforced at the UPF by a per-UE HTB class on the tunnel interface, configured from the subscriber's Session-AMBR. Open5GS does not implement QER-based rate enforcement, so this stands in for the QER an operator UPF applies under TS 29.244. The enforcement point is per-UE and is the only place the agent's policy value acts; the shared bottleneck is at the air interface and is independent of it."
